.TH JUST3WS 1 "October 2026" "just3ws Platform" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
just3ws \- Unified root control plane for the just3ws platform and ecosystem
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B just3ws
\fIdomain\fR \fIaction\fR [\fIoptions\fR]
.br
.B just3ws
\fIlegacy-command\fR [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B just3ws
is the central control plane CLI driver for the just3ws engineering platform,
autonomous media intake toolchain, and ecosystem datalake. Inspired by
.B kubectl
and the
.B zdots-*
personal operating system control planes, it provides a cohesive, namespaced
interface across five primary operational domains:
.TP
.B lake
Ecosystem datalake synthesis across GitHub organizations (@just3ws, @ugtastic,
@wwworkremote, @phalanxduel), local git commits, historical artifacts, and
chronological timeline events. Backed by SQLite3 FTS5, DuckDB, and JSONL streams.
.TP
.B media
Autonomous video intake, Maildir queues (incoming, pending, processing, blocked,
processed, quarantine), BPMN state tracking, resumable chunked YouTube uploads,
DSP audio filtering (dehum), and real-time SSE telemetry streaming.
.TP
.B validate
Repository hygiene gates, Markdown linting, data uniqueness, OBS scene collection
assertions, rendered link integrity, and fast pre-commit verification.
.TP
.B data
Archive data generation, interview transcripts, knowledge graph synthesis,
semantic graph audits, and smart legacy route remapping for historical domains.
.TP
.B site
Jekyll site lifecycle management, local test execution, resume PDF generation,
Playwright smoke testing, and localhost server deployment.
.SH DOMAINS AND ACTIONS
.SS lake
.TP
.B build \fR[\fB--commit-limit \fIN\fR] [\fB--verbose\fR]
Harvests repositories, local git commits, and artifacts across organizations
and builds \fIlake/ecosystem/ecosystem.db\fR, \fIlake/ecosystem/ecosystem.duckdb\fR,
and \fIlake/ecosystem/ecosystem.jsonl\fR.
.TP
.B query \fR[\fB--search \fITERM\fR] [\fB--limit \fIN\fR] [\fB--json\fR]
Executes full-text search with BM25 snippet ranking across repositories, commits,
artifacts, and timeline events using SQLite3 FTS5.
.TP
.B timeline \fR[\fIera\fR] [\fB--limit \fIN\fR] [\fB--json\fR]
Displays the chronological milestone timeline from 2008 to the present.
.TP
.B stats \fR[\fB--json\fR]
Displays aggregate datalake metrics, repository counts by organization, and
top repositories by commit volume.
.TP
.B duckdb \fISQL\fR
Executes analytical SQL queries against native DuckDB views (\fIv_timeline\fR,
\fIv_yearly_activity\fR, \fIv_org_summary\fR, \fIv_language_distribution\fR).
.TP
.B sql \fISQL\fR
Executes raw SQL queries directly against the SQLite3 database.
.SS media
.TP
.B intake \fR[\fB--status\fR|\fB--reprocess\fR]
Inspects Maildir intake queues, locks incoming media files, runs DSP filters,
generates Whisper transcripts, and performs YouTube uploads.
.TP
.B stream
Starts or connects to the near-realtime Server-Sent Events (SSE) telemetry
streamer daemon on localhost port 7025.
.TP
.B swiftbar
Emits structured menu bar telemetry for macOS SwiftBar monitoring.
.TP
.B dedupe \fR[\fB--audit\fR|\fB--target \fIPLAYLIST\fR|\fB--retire-duplicates\fR]
Audits and reconciles YouTube uploads and playlist items, preventing duplicate
byte uploads and repairing non-canonical links.
.TP
.B teleprompter \fIepisode\fR [\fB--textream\fR] [\fB--open\fR]
Compiles 6-act broadcast teleprompter rundowns and native Textream documents.
.TP
.B status
Displays real-time operational status across media intake queues, daemons,
and YouTube quota limits.
.SS validate
.TP
.B fast
Runs fast pre-commit gates: repo hygiene allowlist, Markdown linting, data
uniqueness, and declarative data structure checks.
.TP
.B obs
Validates OBS scene collections, browser source URLs, and overlay states.
.TP
.B all
Runs the complete test and validation suite across RSpec and Jekyll checks.
.SS site
.TP
.B build
Builds the Jekyll static site across all pages and archives.
.TP
.B test
Runs the full RSpec test suite.
.TP
.B verify
Runs smoke verification tests against the local build.
.TP
.B remap \fIurl_or_path\fR
Tests legacy URL paths against the declarative route remapping table.
.TP
.B resumes
Compiles structured YAML resume data into HTML, Markdown, text, and PDF surfaces.
.SH EXAMPLES
.B ./bin/just3ws lake timeline --limit 10
.br
Displays the 10 earliest milestones in the ecosystem timeline.
.PP
.B ./bin/just3ws lake duckdb "SELECT * FROM v_org_summary;"
.br
Executes an analytical summary query across all indexed GitHub organizations.
.PP
.B ./bin/just3ws media status
.br
Checks the Maildir queues, running streamer daemons, and YouTube quota cooldowns.
.PP
.B ./bin/just3ws validate fast
.br
Executes pre-commit fast validation checks in under 4 seconds.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I lake/ecosystem/ecosystem.db
SQLite3 database with FTS5 search table \fIecosystem_fts\fR.
.TP
.I lake/ecosystem/ecosystem.duckdb
DuckDB analytical database with pre-compiled views.
.TP
.I lake/ecosystem/ecosystem.jsonl
JSONL streaming dataset of all organizations, repositories, commits, and events.
.TP
.I lake/ecosystem/ecosystem_manifest.json
Summary manifest with timestamp, counts, and file sizes.
.TP
.I _data/episodes/
YAML manifests for The Sound Above and Errata broadcast episodes.
.TP
.I obs/teleprompter/
Compiled 6-act Textream scripts for teleprompter displays.
.TP
.I assets/subtitles/
Archival and broadcast WebVTT closed-caption tracks.
